{
  "v": 1,
  "name": "Demo motor imagery",
  "presenter": "sequence",
  "library": "../library.json",

  "_comment": [
    "A complete paradigm, as a document. This is what replaces sp_mipuzzleA.qml and its",
    "seventeen siblings: to run a different experiment, write a different one of these -- there",
    "is nothing to build and nothing to copy.",
    "",
    "It needs no image assets, so it runs on any machine. Point `devices` at a real amplifier",
    "and turn `record` on to make it a real session.",
    "",
    "presenter: how the next cue is chosen. `sequence` is the flat trial list every legacy sp_",
    "file used. A speller grid or a media timeline would be another value here -- another",
    "presenter, not another program."
  ],

  "screen": {
    "background": "#000000",
    "fixation": "cross",
    "photodiode": "top-right",
    "photodiodeSize": 0.06
  },

  "trials": {
    "left": {
      "cue": "left_hand",
      "duration": 3000,
      "marker": 10,
      "trigger": 10
    },
    "right": {
      "cue": "right_hand",
      "duration": 3000,
      "marker": 20,
      "trigger": 20
    },
    "rest": {
      "cue": "blank",
      "duration": 2000,
      "marker": 4
    },
    "report": {
      "cue": "prompt_type",
      "until": "key:Space",
      "collect": "text",
      "marker": 900
    }
  },

  "blocks": [
    {
      "name": "practice",
      "repeat": 1,
      "order": "fixed",
      "trials": ["left", "rest", "right", "rest"],
      "isi": { "min": 500, "max": 500 }
    },
    {
      "name": "main",
      "repeat": 6,
      "order": "shuffled",
      "trials": ["left", "right", "rest"],
      "isi": { "min": 800, "max": 1600 }
    },
    {
      "name": "report",
      "repeat": 1,
      "order": "fixed",
      "trials": ["report"]
    }
  ],

  "welcome": { "cue": "welcome", "duration": 3000 },
  "goodbye": { "cue": "goodbye", "duration": 2500 },

  "devices": [],

  "record": {
    "enabled": false,
    "file": "$protocol_$subject_$$$$.h5",
    "streams": []
  }
}
